s but he replies that it was  devastating he also reveals that one  time amanda was close to death and he  thought his life was ending with hers  this is the reason he and helius worked  hard to create the genetic coding method  however pilate claims helius was jealous  that he got all the credit which caused  a rift in their friendship after hearing  everything he has to say amanda comments  that the last part changes every time he  tells her the story then we see ak come  to the rebel group offering help they  create an elaborate plan and assign  specific tasks to everyone before  finally executing it but when they sneak  into the building and are about to enter  the tunnel an alarm rings this is  actually ak and armoros's plan to  separate logos from the rest of the  group and arrest him it works and  eventually he is captured and taken into  the medical room the doctors perform a  memory wipe on him causing him to forget  everything ak feels terrible for doing  what she did to logos after finding out  that his memory was wiped she protests  that she wants to meet him but pilate  warns her to do only the things she is  asked to moreover her presence might  trigger some memories in him ak is  distressed for a few hours before the  twins inform her that they saw logos  earlier ak runs to meet him but he fails  to recognize her he has also been given  a heavier dosage of the maintenance  medicine which has turned him into an  immortal he doesn't feel any pain or  happiness in ak's head he is a living  dead not an immortal it is then revealed  that ak has also not been taking her  maintenance drug since the day she was  told about pilot's true intentions she  finally realizes that she has made a  huge mistake and runs to meet the rest  of the group ak cries apologizes and  begs for forgiveness but the group  doesn't trust her anymore she then tells  them about logos and how he has been  changed into a robot without memories  after repeatedly promising that she has  realized the truth the group counts her  in as their teammate again in the next  scene they abduct logos from a mental  facility he was being kept in they begin  recovering him while pilate finds out  about the disappearance he also  discovers that ak was involved and  blames armoros for not being careful  enough with the people he employs  somewhere else after talking to ak for a  few hours logos finally starts getting  glimpses of the past although he still  has a lot to remember he figures out the  group's purpose and is happy to rejoin  them in the following scene the group is  planning to continue their plan to hack  and reprogram the maintenance system  since ak is not a member of the capitol  anymore she asks for help from the twins  it works and they gain access to the  underground facility they are eventually  successful in changing and overriding  the program while they are at it the  group is fortunate enough to find  diffusers that can be used to turn  people from immortal to mortal then we  see the entire group escaping to the  city they take shelter in between the  mountains by building tents suddenly  logos has an epiphany and uses the  diffuser on himself desperate to feel  emotions he passes out right after which  scares everyone the doctor of the group  helps him and he returns to  consciousness in a few hours aka who is  scared for him finally admits that she  has started to like him logos also tells  her that he feels the same in the  following scene the group finds out that  pilot is launching a new program today  that will strengthen his hold on humans  he wants to deliver a live message to  his people but the system is hacked by  the group instead of pilot logos appears  on the screen and tells the people  everything about pilot's unethical way  of controlling everyone he asks them to  think freely at least once and promises  that everything will be crystal clear to  them after that the people are riled up  upon hearing the long speech armoros 